{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_01",
  "title": "高空墜物",
  "storyCode": "RI-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7ddc60195a964a08dc11b91c76ea118e66447258494ca034053cb37498c4ac96",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這裡有你想要的一切。\n你所渴望的片刻安寧、沒有戰爭的大地、母親的懷抱。\n你的意識無限擴張，你掙脫了枷鎖，你自由了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "什麼是自由？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "通常意義上，自由是一種相對的狀態，它意味著沒有束縛，但這麼說著的人往往依然被他的肉體所束縛。\n但你真正的自由了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我自由了！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "沒錯，我親愛的朋友，你永遠地、永永遠遠地自由了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你如同時間長河中的一顆頑石，它將會帶走你的責任、宿命、欲望、聯繫，但唯有你自身，你將永遠地存在於這裡。\n你不擁有任何東西，任何東西也不擁有你。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "沒有比這更棒的事了！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "你理解了一切，現在的你正在與某個未知的存在對話，你應當敬畏，獻上你最純潔的血。\n或者，你只是單純因為衝擊而陷入了昏迷狀態，在跟臆想中的自己進行一場毫無意義的對話。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "責任、宿命、欲望、聯繫......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我要在這裡建立我的王國！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "絕妙的選擇，我的國王，這裡比大地更廣闊，你可以在這裡建立一切你想要的東西。\n那麼首先，先來建立一個國家吧，國家的名字就叫存在國怎麼樣？\n建立在虛無之上的國家將永遠屹立不倒——\n哦不，該死，我們的偉業看起來要在此中斷了。\n如同窗簾間射入的一道光，強烈的酸痛感瞬間佔據了你的所有意識。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不，我反悔了，我更喜歡痛苦。",
          "value": "4",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "你喜歡痛苦，你喜歡付出，你喜歡主動投身火焰，你喜歡讓自己受傷。\n聰明人總是想要一場恰到好處的失敗，一些可以及時止損的失去，他們認為這樣可以最有效地讓自己成長。\n不要自大，我的虛無部書記。\n那麼，首先，先給你來一些你最喜歡的痛苦吧——\n從你的全身各處的肌肉上，傳來了極度酸痛的感覺。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你說得對，我該休息了。",
          "value": "5",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "好的，親愛的，這就對了。\n放輕鬆，我來為你唱一首搖籃曲，你將永久地睡去，不受一絲侵擾。\n哦，但是，就在你要入睡時，一種強烈的感覺突然向你襲來——這是痛楚！\n隨之而來的，是一個遙遠但是熟悉的聲音。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "......士，博士！"
            },
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "阿米婭？不，不是，這個聲音比阿米婭更加成熟。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "躺這麼久了還不醒，真麻煩。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "......和暴力。\n你感覺到可能是自己臉頰的部位受到了幾次衝擊，看來對方還有言出必行的優良品質。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "怎麼辦，這都不醒，反正阿米婭不在，把博士抓起來來幾圈大風車試試好了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "大風車？好玩嗎，我也要玩！"
            },
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "對方似乎要採用激烈手段了，而且插進來的這個聲音，帶著一絲純真。\n純真這項美好的特質在這種情境下的含義是，她是認真的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不，有人在等我。",
          "value": "6",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "哦，是的，我承認，那是些好孩子。\n但你有沒有想過，沒有你他們也能夠前進，你並不對他們負責。\n你的責任、你的宿命、你的欲望、你與他們的聯繫，一切只是你的妄想？\n......好吧，我知道你已經決定，那麼，給你一個驚喜吧，沒錯，就是你最喜歡的痛苦！\n從你的全身各處的肌肉上，傳來了極度酸痛的感覺。\n隨之而來的，是一個遙遠但是熟悉的聲音。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "......士，博士！"
            },
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "阿米婭？不，不是，這個聲音比阿米婭更加成熟。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "躺這麼久了還不醒，真麻煩。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "......和暴力。\n你感覺到可能是自己臉頰的部位受到了幾次衝擊，看來對方還有言出必行的優良品質。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "怎麼辦，這都不醒，反正阿米婭不在，把博士抓起來來幾圈大風車試試好了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "大風車？好玩嗎，我也要玩！"
            },
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "對方似乎要採用激烈手段了，而且插進來的這個聲音，帶著一絲純真。\n純真這項美好的特質在這種情境下的含義是，她是認真的。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不，我要回去！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "narration",
              "text": "哦，很遺憾，有些旅行不是由你的意志決定的，你已經失去了踏上這次旅行的機會。\n不過不要緊張，機會還有很多。現在，讓我們睜開雙眼......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "睜開雙眼",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嘉維爾，大風車應該怎麼玩呀？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所謂大風車，就是你要把對方的腿或者手抓起來，然後開始旋轉起來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等到你覺得差不多了就把他丟出去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "聽起來好好玩！我可以試試嗎！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可以啊，我來接住博士就是了......嗯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你終於醒了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊，博士醒了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "小刻，別一下子就跳到博士身上去，博士被你這麼一壓說不定又要昏過去了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哦，對不起，博士！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你們沒事吧？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "沒事，這點高度，小意思。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
              "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "我也沒事！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "喂，不是吧博士，你難道又摔失憶了？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "剛剛你是不是扇我了？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我失憶了。",
          "value": "4",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "博士，你別忘了，我是醫生。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "總之，博士，我來簡單說明一下情況吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "總而言之，我們墜機了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
              "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "從很高的地方摔了下來！咻——！碰！這樣。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "姐姐，你是誰？",
          "value": "5",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "還會開玩笑，看起來沒有大礙。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "總之，博士，我來簡單說明一下情況吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "總而言之，我們墜機了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
              "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "從很高的地方摔了下來！咻——！碰！這樣。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "詳細一點。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "太簡單了吧！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嘖，好吧，總之，博士你運氣不太好，我們被攻擊的時候爆炸正好發生在你座位附近，你直接被炸飛撞到牆上就暈倒了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "放心，你的傷口我已經包紮過了，問題不大，而且和你剛到羅德島的時候比，你的體質可好了不少。不錯啊，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "嗚嗚，博士，對不起，我應該接住你的，但是我被爆炸聲嚇到了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "這也不能怪你，老實說，就算是我也想不到他們居然還有能對空的武器了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "也就是說你早就料到會被攻擊了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "是啊，我沒說過嗎，我老家這裡的人很好鬥的，雖然他們都打不過我。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "其他人呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "在下墜的時候，為了控制高度，其他人中途就先跳下去了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "為了保護你，我和刻俄柏是最後才跳下來的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "哦對，Lancet-2應該還留在飛行器上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "飛行器呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我沒記錯的話，在那個方向吧，喏，那邊那個山坡過去應該就是了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "先過去看看吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "你看，那就是我們的飛行器。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "唔哦，在冒煙呢，感覺不能用了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "不過看起來還能修的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，嘉維爾，飛行器那邊有人！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯？那是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerToken": "char_285_medic2_1",
          "operatorId": "char_285_medic2",
          "portraitKey": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "請不要靠近我，雖然我有保護羅德島財產的義務，但我只是一台醫療器械，嗚嗚......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "喂，這台機器好像會說話啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是啊，沒想到天上掉下來個這麼厲害的機器不說，裡面還有會說話的機器！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "喂，你們說，該不會它裡面其實裝著個人吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不知道，要不然我們把它也搶回去吧，酋長肯定會喜歡的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好啊，弟兄們，我們把它也扛回去！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
          "speakerToken": "char_285_medic2_1",
          "operatorId": "char_285_medic2",
          "portraitKey": "char_285_medic2",
          "text": "救命啊——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "給我住手！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......&%（什麼人？！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "敢搶我們的東西，你們活得不耐煩了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......￥%%#（誰能證明這就是你的東西，它是從天上掉下來的！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "！@#%......&（沒錯，是我們先到的，所以就是我們的！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嘖，還挺有道理。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嘉維爾，他們在說什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嗯？哦對，忘了博士你們聽不懂我們這裡的語言了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "雖然這裡也是薩爾貢，但是這裡的人沒有會用普通的薩爾貢語的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "這樣吧，要是有要傳達給你的話我給你翻譯一下好了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "其他時候就意會一下吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......&*#（在那邊嘀嘀咕咕說什麼呢混帳！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我在說，既然這是你們的東西，那只要把你們全都放倒，它就是我的了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "&&......！@（什麼？這個女人太囂張了，弟兄們，上！）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
